[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/world/SCRIPT_arena_field.gd" id="1_field"]

; THE PAC-MAN ARENA'S GROUND. Golf's ISLANDFIELD_hub_solid, run through ArenaField
; (scripts/world/SCRIPT_arena_field.gd): the same hub island, now just the far
; backdrop, with a flat 112 x 124 m maze floor at its centre, a treeline on the
; three far sides and a grass meadow on the camera's side (+Z).
;
; Changed from hub_solid: golf zones, the crash crater, the pod's divot and the ruin
; clearings are all OFF (nothing of golf's game stands here), the hills are lower
; (14 m / 3 m ridges, from 24 / 5) so the forest reads as a backdrop rather than
; terrain, and forest_coverage is up (0.55 from 0.38) so the woods past the
; treeline stay woods.

